Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.57,0:00:54.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（俄国边境的恐怖分子军火市场）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.44,0:01:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的人在中央摄影机的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our man's in position on the center camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.74,0:01:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里好像恐怖分子的超级市场\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a terrorist supermarket.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.91,0:01:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,中国的长征导弹 黑豹AS-565型攻击直升机…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chinese Long March Scud, Panther AS-565 attack helicopter…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.41,0:01:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,一对俄国迫击炮 那箱子看起来像是美国的步枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}a pair of Russian mortars, and the crates look like American rifles.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.32,0:01:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,智利的地雷 德国的炸药 真是货式齐全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chilean mines, German explosives. Fun for the whole family.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.75,0:01:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,请辨识身分\N{\fnArial\fs30}I.D.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.66,0:01:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,白骑士 给我们看看那些爪牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}White Rook to White Knight. Show us the pawns.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.29,0:01:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 他真的混进去了 将军 由中间那个人开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, he did get through, Admiral. Start with that chap in the middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.13,0:01:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动辨认身分的电脑程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}Load the I.D. program, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.40,0:01:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,搜寻身分资料库\N{\fnArial\fs30}Data base I.D. search.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.40,0:01:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在查询资料库\N{\fnArial\fs30}Checking the databases.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.40,0:01:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,已找到第一个人 他是石原聪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got out first match. Satoshi Isagura.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.44,0:01:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,化学专家 因东京地铁袭击事件被通缉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chemical expert. Wanted for the Tokyo subway attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.14,0:02:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前在非洲萨伊为叛军工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Currently working for the insurgent force in Zaire.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.78,0:02:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利古达 美国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry Gupta. American.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.42,0:02:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,高科技恐怖主义的鼻祖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Practically invented techno-terrorism.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.22,0:02:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,在60年代 他是柏克莱大学的激进学生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Started out as a student radical at Berkeley in the '60s.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.15,0:02:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他以出售恐怖主义谋生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now he sells his politics for cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.16,0:02:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,放大那个 可以吗？好像是美国的编码器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zoom in on that, can you? That looks like an American encoder.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.63,0:02:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,用来控制 全球定位导航卫星系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}They use it to control their navigation satellites: the G.P.S. system.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.19,0:02:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪一样会令中央情报局生气 他们失去它还是我们找到它？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder, will the C.I.A. be more upset that they lost it or that we found it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.80,0:02:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Admiral?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.77,0:02:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 M 我们看够了 该是军事行动的时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, M, we've seen enough. This is now a military operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.61,0:02:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到那支盖特林机关枪吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw the Gatling gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.51,0:02:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的军队应付得来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are your troops prepared for that kind of firepower?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.98,0:02:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们下星期将在莫斯科进行选举\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have election in Moscow next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.32,0:02:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统不希望有士兵伤亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}The president said any loss of life is unacceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.22,0:02:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会接受海军的提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll take the naval option.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.95,0:02:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次攻击就能消灭 全球一半的恐怖分子\N{\fnArial\fs30}In one strike, we take out half the world's terrorists.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.19,0:02:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁巴克将军 我反对 联络柴斯特号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral Roebuck, I must protest. Get me the Chester.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.79,0:02:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要浪费时间 我的属下还没完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best not waste time. My man isn't finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.36,0:02:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑将军呼叫白仕 可以发射了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Black King to White Bishop. Authorization to fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.60,0:03:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫你的手下离开 他的工作已经完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your man out of there. His job is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.81,0:03:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,武器授权完成 准备发射导弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weapons authorized. Prepare to fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.81,0:03:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒数计时 五 四 三 二 一\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my count. Five, four, three, two, one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.21,0:03:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,导弹已经发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missile away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.59,0:03:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,将于四分八秒后击中目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to target: four minutes, eight seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.32,0:03:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,白骑士 四分钟后爆炸 立即离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}White Knight, four minutes to impact. Get out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.96,0:03:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这是什么 就在我面前的荧幕里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, damn it, I know what it is! It's on the screen in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.56,0:03:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是飞机前的吉普车\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a jeep in front of a plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.37,0:03:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上离开那里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, get the hell out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.44,0:03:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,究竟发生什么事？不能再等\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's going on? You will not wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.17,0:03:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是命令 你的属下在等什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's an order! What is your man waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.91,0:03:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,白骑士？我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}White Knight? Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.01,0:03:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些是苏联SB-5核子鱼雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are Soviet SB-5 nuclear torpedoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.82,0:03:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果导弹击中这里… 叫他们终止导弹攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the Cruise hits them… Order them to abort the missile.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.72,0:03:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国皇家柴斯特号 紧急情况 白骑士 请回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}H.M.S. Chester urgent. White Knight, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.69,0:03:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,终止导弹攻击…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abort missile. Abort missile.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.93,0:03:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,终止导弹攻击 终止导弹攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abort missile. Abort missile.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.03,0:04:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 导弹已经太远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, sir, missile out of range.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.93,0:04:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们无法摧毁导弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unable to destroy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.91,0:04:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,白骑士… 通知北约跟美国国防部\N{\fnArial\fs30}White Knight… Alert NATO, the Pentagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.78,0:04:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 导弹会引爆鱼雷吗？- 可能会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Will it trigger the torpedoes? - It might.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.45,0:04:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算不会 那里的辐射…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But even if it does not, there's enough plutonium…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.31,0:04:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,将会比车诺比核电厂的更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}to make Chernobyl look like picnic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.28,0:04:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,真糟糕！你们不能好好把东西锁起来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bloody hell! Can't you people keep anything locked up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.59,0:04:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有军队撤退 叫他立刻离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evacuate your troops, and get him out of there, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.32,0:04:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,白骑士 请回答…\N{\fnArial\fs30}White Knight, come in. White Knight, come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.63,0:04:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续试 白骑士 请回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep trying, damn it! White Knight, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.57,0:04:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复 白骑士请回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repeat, White Knight, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.25,0:04:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏习惯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Filthy habit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.60,0:05:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿到编码器了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got the encoder.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.14,0:05:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在做什么？- 他在执行任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell is he doing? - His job.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.28,0:05:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要去抢鱼雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going for the bombs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.07,0:05:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,去拿那吉普车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get that jeep!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.98,0:05:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 快离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of it, James.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.51,0:06:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,导弹一分钟后到达\N{\fnArial\fs30}One minute to impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.90,0:07:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,导弹三十秒后到达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirty seconds to impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.51,0:09:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,多事的傢伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Backseat driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.82,0:09:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,白骑士呼叫白车\N{\fnArial\fs30}White Knight to White Rook.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.88,0:09:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经安全撤退\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've evacuated the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.42,0:09:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,问问将军 他想将鱼雷送到哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask the admiral where he'd like his bombs delivered.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.16,0:10:00.06,Title,0,0,0,0,,《007系列之明日帝国》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.81,0:12:44.15,Note,0,0,0,0,,（南中国海 英国皇家得文夏号）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.15,0:12:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,开动警报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sound the general alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.86,0:12:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,两架中国米格机刚刚飞过上空\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ship has been overflown by two Chinese MiGs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.80,0:12:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们相信他们怀有敌意\N{\fnArial\fs30}We believe they have hostile intent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.80,0:13:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands to action stations.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.77,0:13:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国皇家得文夏号 这是你们最后一次警告\N{\fnArial\fs30}H.M.S. Devonshire. This is your last warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.07,0:13:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们已在中国领海\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are in Chinese territorial waters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.68,0:13:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,警戒员 全速航行 左转40度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officer of the Watch, maximum speed. Come left 40 degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.95,0:13:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 长官 旋转速度160 转舵向左20度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye, aye, sir. Revolutions 1-6-0, port 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.92,0:13:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们疯了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.93,0:13:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,中国飞行员坚称 我们离他们的海岸线11英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Chinese pilot insists that we are only 11 miles off their coast…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.80,0:13:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,若不开进中国港口 他会开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he will fire if we don't turn around and go to a Chinese port.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.40,0:13:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,回覆他：「我们在国际水域…」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send this: "We are in international waters…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.14,0:13:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,「如果受到袭击必会反击」\N{\fnArial\fs30}and will defend ourselves if attacked."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.14,0:13:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,将副本急送将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy all this to the Admiralty, urgent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.31,0:13:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们肯定我们的方位吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we absolutely sure of our position?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.85,0:13:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定 是卫星定位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir. An exact satellite fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.49,0:13:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉堡卡佛媒体集团网络\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carver Media Group Network, Hamburg.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.08,0:14:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已准备好发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, we are ready to launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.42,0:14:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,关掉引擎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut down the engines.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.42,0:14:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持静默\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maintain full silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.66,0:14:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷达探测不到隐形船 但却可探测到海钻\N{\fnArial\fs30}A stealth ship may be invisible to radar but the Seadrill isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.77,0:14:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,米格机再飞过时便发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll launch next time the MiGs fly by…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.60,0:14:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国人会认为是中国的空中鱼雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the British will think it's a Chinese aerial torpedo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.84,0:14:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该去报告了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should report in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.45,0:14:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,史丹博呼叫汉堡 第一步行动已经展开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stamper to Hamburg. Phase one is in progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.42,0:14:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚点会再报告最新情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll report back to you with an update.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.26,0:15:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,米格机又来了 开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The MiGs are making another pass. Let's start the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.26,0:15:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下海钻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seadrill in position.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.28,0:15:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,开动海钻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start the drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.15,0:15:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,放出去 海钻放出了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Release it. Seadrill away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.73,0:15:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿色-30 有鱼雷…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Green 3-0, torpedo, torpedo, torpedo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.50,0:15:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,中央方位114\N{\fnArial\fs30}Center bearing 1-1-4.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.50,0:15:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,警戒员 急右转141\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officer of the Watch, come hard right, 1-4-1.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.50,0:15:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,声纳没有收到讯号 一定是米格机放下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's been no sonar contact, sir. The MiGs must have dropped it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.11,0:15:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,方位稳定 它会击中我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bearing steady. It's gonna hit, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.38,0:15:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备被撞击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brace, brace, brace.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.69,0:16:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标是1200 开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target: 1200. Knock knock.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.94,0:16:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,到楼上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.12,0:16:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,左转 旋转90度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn left. Rotating 90 degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.17,0:16:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们正在猜为什么鱼雷没爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now they're wondering why the torpedo hasn't exploded.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.97,0:16:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,全面损毁报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}PWO, Captain. Full damage report.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.38,0:17:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,立即开动后备能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Backup power, immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.98,0:17:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,开动替代能源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Switch to alternate supply.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.92,0:17:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,三具发电机损毁 船尾第四层淹水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three generators are down, sir. Flooding on four deck aft.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.22,0:17:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,船头向下14度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, we're now down 14 degrees by the stern.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.59,0:17:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,通知将军：「遭中国米格机 鱼雷击中 下沉中」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeoman, send to Admiralty: "Have been torpedoed by Chinese MiGs. Sinking."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.10,0:17:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,说出我们的方位 好的 弃船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give them our position. Right. Abandon ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.43,0:17:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,弃船…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abandon ship! Abandon ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.30,0:17:32.83,Note,0,0,0,0,,（遭米格机鱼雷击中下沉中）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.91,0:17:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部上甲板\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone on deck! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.39,0:17:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,对米格机发射一枚导弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}One missile at the MiGs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.27,0:18:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持无线电静默\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maintaining radio silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.41,0:18:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们最后的发报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their last broadcast, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.15,0:18:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,古达的编码器见效了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Gupta's little trick with the encoder worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.08,0:18:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们报告最后的位置 是离此70里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They gave their final position 70 miles from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.29,0:18:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国海军永远找不到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The British Navy will never find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.76,0:18:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,海面有生还者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Survivors in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.17,0:18:33.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（英国海军遇害）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.34,0:18:40.67,Note,0,0,0,0,,（英国海军被谋杀）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.74,0:18:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,史丹博先生 我正在写标题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Stamper, I'm having fun with my headlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.65,0:18:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要知道生还者的正确数目\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to know the exact number of survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.58,0:18:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开会要迟到了 确保用正确的子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I'm late for a meeting. Make sure you use the right kind of ammunition.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.45,0:18:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.36,0:18:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,太美妙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.49,0:19:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始打捞行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start the recovery operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.89,0:19:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,派潜水员到得文夏号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send our divers down to the Devonshire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.57,0:19:46.51,Note,0,0,0,0,,（导弹室）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.72,0:19:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,古达先生？已完成第一阶段\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Gupta? Phase one is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.40,0:20:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安 忠心的员工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, my golden retrievers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.50,0:20:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天卡佛集团该为世界 制造什么混乱呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of havoc shall the Carver Media Group create in the world today?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.90,0:20:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,新闻 巴基斯坦水灾 巴黎暴动\N{\fnArial\fs30}News. Floods in Pakistan, riots in Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.11,0:20:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,加州坠机 好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a plane crash in California. Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.41,0:20:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼斯先生 我们准备好推出新软件了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Jones, are we ready to release our new software?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.55,0:20:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 如你的要求 有许多问题…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir. As requested, it's full of bugs…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.05,0:20:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们在未来会被迫将软件升级\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means people will be forced to upgrade for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.65,0:20:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,了不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.86,0:20:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃勒斯先生 打电话给总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Wallace, call the president.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.09,0:20:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他如不签署降低 有线电视收费的法案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him if he doesn't sign the bill lowering the cable rates…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.56,0:20:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会播出他在芝加哥饭店…\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll release a video of him with the cheerleader…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.60,0:20:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鬼混的录影带 - 知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- in the Chicago motel room. - Inspired, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.60,0:20:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他签署后仍将录影带播出\N{\fnArial\fs30}After he signs the bill, release the tape anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.10,0:20:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consider him slimed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.81,0:20:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.04,0:20:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在七号应答器 史丹博？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's on transponder seven. Mr. Stamper?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.61,0:21:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始第二阶段 我有录影带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phase two is underway. I have the videotape.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.08,0:21:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没看过 但听说片段很精彩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't seen it myself, but I'm told the footage is excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.12,0:21:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有17名生还者 可让你作标题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus, there were 17 survivors for your headlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.02,0:21:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good work, Stamper.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.10,0:21:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 - 不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - Don't mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.00,0:21:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,确保放在安全地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure you keep it in a safe place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.93,0:21:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen and ladies…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.17,0:21:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,停止所有的印刷\N{\fnArial\fs30}hold the presses.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.81,0:21:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚收到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This just in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.81,0:21:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,在稀奇突发的命运下 今晚卫星新闻网络…\N{\fnArial\fs30}By a curious quirk of fate, we have the perfect story…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.31,0:21:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,的首播有大新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}with which to launch our Satellite News Network tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.12,0:21:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,南中国海好像 正在耘酿一个小危机\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems a small crisis is brewing in the South China Sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.62,0:21:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要报章全面报导 杂志报导\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want full newspaper coverage. I want magazine stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.33,0:21:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,书刊 电影 电视及电台广播\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want books. I want films. I want TV. I want radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.26,0:21:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要我们24小时转播\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want us on the air 24 hours a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.17,0:21:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.07,0:21:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球上有十亿人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a billion people around this planet…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.14,0:21:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,会收看 收听…\N{\fnArial\fs30}will watch it, hear it…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.77,0:22:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,和阅读 由卡佛媒体集团报导的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}and read about it from the Carver Media Group.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.98,0:22:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有什么比得上坏消息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no news like bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.66,0:22:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生 我对你的进展很满意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am pleased with your progress, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.00,0:22:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都有兴趣学习新语言 教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always enjoyed studying a new tongue, Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.44,0:22:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很有天分\N{\fnArial\fs30}One might say you have a natural ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.48,0:22:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但熟能生巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But practice makes perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.66,0:22:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹麦话「我不在」怎么说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you say "I'm not here" in Danish?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.93,0:22:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just ignore it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.56,0:22:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他们的词汇里没有这些字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are words they just don't have in their vocabulary.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.94,0:23:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是邦德 用安全线路 007\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond here. Go to a secure line, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.67,0:23:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,用干扰器 第四频道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going to a scrambler, channel four.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.24,0:23:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,太荒谬了 他们在国际水域\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's ridiculous. That ship was in international waters.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.64,0:23:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能肯定 詹姆斯？你在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't be certain. James? Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.08,0:23:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱班霓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Moneypenny.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.65,0:23:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在牛津练习一下丹麦语\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just up here at Oxford brushing up on a little Danish.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.59,0:23:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,一下？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.06,0:23:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕你得跟你的课程吻别了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid you're going to have to kiss off your lesson, James.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.73,0:23:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,国防部有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got a situation here at the Ministry of Defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.43,0:23:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,要派舰队到中国\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're sending the fleet to China.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.03,0:23:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一小时后到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be there in an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.60,0:23:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,半小时吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make that 30 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.57,0:23:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 我的甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good-bye, my sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.58,0:23:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一向都是口舌巧妙的语言家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always were a cunning linguist, James.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.75,0:23:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,别问 别说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't ask. Don't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.30,0:24:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太不合理了 我们知道军舰的正确方位\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's preposterous. We know exactly where that ship was positioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.03,0:24:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,全球定位卫星不可能会出错\N{\fnArial\fs30}The G.P.S. system… Global Positioning Satellites… do not lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.47,0:24:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 但是新加坡控制中心 在军舰受到攻击时…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but our Singapore station picked up a mysterious signal…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.48,0:24:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,全球定位卫星 截获了神秘的讯号\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the G.P.S. frequency at the time of the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.61,0:24:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那有可能让军舰偏离航道\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could've sent that ship off course.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.61,0:24:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 英国巡洋舰失踪了 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have a missing British frigate… - I'm aware of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.72,0:24:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只想调查而不采取果断的行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}And instead of decisive action, all you want to do is investigate.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.15,0:24:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望避免第三次世界大战 而且我不认为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My goal is to prevent World War Three, Admiral, and I don't think…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.59,0:24:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,派舰队去寻找地点是最好的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}sending an armada into the recovery area is the best way to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.69,0:24:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些神秘的全球定位卫星信号 从哪里发出来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where, exactly, did this mysterious G.P.S. signal come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.03,0:24:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们仍在调查 - 「调查」\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're still investigating. - "Investigating."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.03,0:24:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,M 我看你没种执行任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}M, sometimes I don't think you have the balls for this job.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.80,0:24:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许吧 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps, but the advantage is…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.24,0:24:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来都不用担心这个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have to think with them all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.34,0:24:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 现在的情形是如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's enough. Now, where do we stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.31,0:24:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的军舰 在国际水域受到无谓的攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was an unprovoked attack on a ship in international waters.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.45,0:24:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们派舰队去搜索跟准备反击\N{\fnArial\fs30}We send in the fleet for recovery and prepare for full retaliation.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.18,0:24:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,用温和的作法展开我们的调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moderation. We investigate…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.62,0:25:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是派遣英国海军舰队…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and stop short of sending the entire British Navy…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.92,0:25:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入世界最大空军的领域内\N{\fnArial\fs30}within ten minutes of the world's largest air force.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.19,0:25:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们的舰队何时能到达？- 48小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}- When will our ships be in position? - Forty-eight hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.33,0:25:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.53,0:25:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,报章已要求报复\N{\fnArial\fs30}The press are already screaming for blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.53,0:25:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能让局势变得更紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last thing we want to do is escalate the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.67,0:25:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕已经太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid it may be too late to worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.34,0:25:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,17名英国海军被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seventeen British sailors murdered!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.38,0:25:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,「据发现尸体的越南官员宣称」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"According to Vietnamese officials who recovered the bodies…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.15,0:25:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,「死者被中国空军子弹」\N{\fnArial\fs30}the victims were riddled with the same ammunition…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.98,0:25:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,「打得满是窟窿」\N{\fnArial\fs30}used by the Chinese Air Force."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.51,0:25:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是你泄露出去的吗？- 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you leak this? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.16,0:25:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我第一次听到 - 就这样决定吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's the first I've heard of it. - Well, this settles it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.93,0:25:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们派舰队去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We send in the fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.20,0:25:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,M 你有48小时的时间调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}M, you have 48 hours to investigate.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.87,0:25:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,有件事很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is one strange thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.88,0:25:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我打电话给西贡的人员时 他说越南人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I called our contact in Saigon, he said the Vietnamese…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.54,0:25:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,在三小时前才发现海军的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}only found our sailors three hours ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.88,0:26:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,报纸怎会这么快就刊出？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd they get the paper out so fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.58,0:26:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,明日报的人 比越南政府更早知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody at Tomorrow knew before the Vietnamese government did.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.29,0:26:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道多少艾利欧卡佛的事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much do you know about Elliot Carver, 007?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.12,0:26:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,全球媒体大亨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worldwide media baron.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.59,0:26:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,可藉报导推翻政府\N{\fnArial\fs30}Able to topple governments with a single broadcast.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.43,0:26:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,明日报是卡佛的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carver owns that newspaper Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.23,0:26:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想在部长面前讨论这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want to discuss it in front of the minister…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.53,0:26:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些神秘信号 来自卡佛的其中一个卫星\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that mysterious signal came from one of Carver's satellites.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.04,0:26:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果首相知道你在调查他 一定会杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The P.M. would have my head if he knew you were investigating him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.64,0:26:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,007 我派你去汉堡 我们已经安排好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sending you to Hamburg, 007. We've arranged for you to be invited…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.68,0:26:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你受邀参加卡佛媒体集团的酒会\N{\fnArial\fs30}to a party at Carver's Media Center.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.85,0:26:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们庆祝发射新卫星\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're celebrating the launch of a new satellite…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.35,0:26:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他现在有能力 将消息传播到世界的每个角落\N{\fnArial\fs30}because now he has the ability to reach every human being on the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.12,0:26:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是中国拒绝给他广播权\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except the Chinese, who have refused broadcast rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.66,0:26:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的机票 掩护的身分 跟租车预约的收据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your ticket, cover story and rental car reservation.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.39,0:26:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,请签名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sign here, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.13,0:26:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得你曾跟卡佛的太太 有过一段情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you once had a relationship with Carver's wife, Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.83,0:26:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那已是陈年往事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a long time ago, M…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.24,0:26:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,在她结婚之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}before she was married.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.47,0:27:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不晓得原来是众所周知的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't realize it was public knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.61,0:27:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,请以国家为重 詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Queen and country, James.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.71,0:27:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的责任是要找出 是否卡佛或他的下属…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your job is to find out whether Carver or someone in his organization…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.68,0:27:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,让军舰偏离航道 还有他这样做的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}sent that ship off course and why.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.92,0:27:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽量利用你跟卡佛太太的关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use your relationship with Mrs. Carver if necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.99,0:27:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很怀疑她还记不记得我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I doubt if she'll remember me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.36,0:27:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就去提醒她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remind her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.36,0:27:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,从她身上刺探出消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then pump her for information.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.20,0:27:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要决定如何刺探出消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll just have to decide how much pumping is needed, James.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.40,0:27:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱班霓 如果我跟你是这样就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If only that were true of you and I, Moneypenny.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.88,0:28:07.11,Note,0,0,0,0,,（明日报：中国警告英国舰队）
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.11,0:28:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你在这里签名 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'll just sign here, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.68,0:28:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你漂亮的新车的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the insurance damage waiver…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.02,0:28:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,保险损毁豁免书\N{\fnArial\fs30}for your beautiful new car.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.09,0:28:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你需要碰撞保险吗？- 需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Will you need collision coverage? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.82,0:28:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,火险呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.32,0:28:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.59,0:28:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 财物保险呢？- 当然要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Property destruction? - Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.40,0:28:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤亡保险呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Personal injury?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.17,0:28:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望不要 但意外有时难以避免\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope not, but accidents do happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.57,0:28:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要有你 意外是跑不掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}They frequently do with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.17,0:28:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样应该可以了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that takes care of the normal wear and tear.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.04,0:28:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还需要其他的保护吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I need any other protection?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.84,0:28:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你弄坏车子 我会修理你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only from me, 007, unless you bring that car back in pristine order.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.32,0:28:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你先请 - 你先请\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shall we? - Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.85,0:28:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的新宝马750\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your new BMW 750.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.76,0:29:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,做了一般精细的设备 有机关枪 火箭炮…\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the usual refinements… machine guns, rockets…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.63,0:29:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,全球卫星定位系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}the G.P.S. tracking system.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.53,0:29:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎 请系上安全带 遵照指示以确保安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome. Please fasten seat belt and obey all instructions for a safe trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.44,0:29:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你比较注意女性的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you'd pay more attention to a female voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.17,0:29:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想我们见过面了 - 我对你那些…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think we've met. - I am not interested…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.58,0:29:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,脏脏的恶作剧没什么兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}in your sordid escapades.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.61,0:29:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们继续吧 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get on with it, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.58,0:29:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的新电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your new telephone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.58,0:29:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,听跟说都是这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk here, listen here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.42,0:29:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以这几年我都做错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's what I've been doing wrong all these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.59,0:29:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,它还有指纹扫瞄…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It also includes a fingerprint scanner…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.12,0:29:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟两万瓦的保全系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a 20, 000-volt security system.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.13,0:29:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我最得意的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this I'm particularly proud of…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.23,0:29:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你车子的遥控器\N{\fnArial\fs30}the remote control for your car.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.17,0:29:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,压两次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tap twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.94,0:29:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.01,0:29:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,移动你的手指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, draw your finger…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.47,0:29:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢地划过垫子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}very slowly across the pad…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.14,0:29:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,来开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}to drive the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.92,0:30:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,做起来有点困难但经过练习…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's surprisingly difficult to drive, but with practice…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.62,0:30:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来看看 她对我的触摸有什么反应？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's see how she responds to my touch, eh, Q?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.72,0:30:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很了解彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we understand each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.72,0:30:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,别那么幼稚了 007\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grow up, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.17,0:30:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意 车子仍开动 请关上门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attention. Engine running. Please shut door now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.31,0:30:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让她玩得团团转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let her push you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.69,0:31:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些恶意的谣言完全不正确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, there's absolutely no truth in this malicious rumor…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.09,0:31:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,竟然说是我开始 报导狂牛病事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I started running Mad Cow Disease stories…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.73,0:31:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为英国的牛肉大王 安格斯布拉克爵士…\N{\fnArial\fs30}simply because Sir Angus Black, the great British beef baron…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.66,0:31:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,在牌局中输给我一万镑 最后又不认帐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Iost 10, 000 pounds to me in a game of poker and refused to pay up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.07,0:31:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个谣言更不正确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moreover, there's even less truth in the rumor…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.17,0:31:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,说法国给我一亿法郎\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I took 100 million francs from the French…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.21,0:31:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我在未来的一年中 继续报导这则新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}to keep the stories running for another year.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.51,0:31:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰了 卡佛先生 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, Mr. Carver. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.35,0:31:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是新来的银行家\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the new banker, Mr…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.28,0:31:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond. James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.29,0:31:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个新银行家 我好像在收集他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another new banker. I seem to collect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.39,0:31:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,请告诉我 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.69,0:31:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,市场对这次危机的反应如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the market reacting to the crisis?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.26,0:31:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,货币下跌 你们公司的股票正在上升\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, currencies are off. Your stock is soaring.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.70,0:31:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以前没见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe we have met.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.60,0:31:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是艾利欧卡佛 - 我是林葳\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Elliot Carver. - Wai Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.90,0:31:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在中国新华社工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm from the New China News Agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.11,0:32:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没在宾客名单看到你的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't recall seeing your name on the guest list.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.27,0:32:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,坦白说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a confession.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.94,0:32:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是偷溜进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not. I snuck in.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.41,0:32:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要这么做 亲爱的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you do that, my dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.05,0:32:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.08,0:32:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.09,0:32:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我欣赏主动的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I admire a woman who takes the initiative.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.06,0:32:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该在我的北京分社工作 卡佛先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should work in my Beijing bureau. Mr. Carver.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.59,0:32:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在北京没有分社 - 叫我艾利欧就可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't have a bureau in Beijing. - Call me Elliot.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.65,0:32:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.29,0:32:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我说了什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it something I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.03,0:32:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,对「我马上回来」这句话 有印象吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about the words, "I'll be right back?"
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.48,0:33:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 卡佛太太要一杯 卡佛先生的香槟\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Mrs. Carver will have a glass of Mr. Carver's champagne.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.92,0:33:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你的身分提高了不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you've moved up in the world, Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.09,0:33:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚你是个银行家 我看到宾客名单\N{\fnArial\fs30}And tonight, you're a banker. I saw the guest list.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.63,0:33:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你睡觉时仍将枪放在枕头下吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, James, do you still sleep with a gun under your pillow?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.68,0:33:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬你 不 敬你的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}To you. No, to the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.72,0:33:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你不是为社交活动来的吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I take it this isn't a social visit?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.59,0:33:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先生可能有麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your husband may be in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.69,0:33:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是传播界之王\N{\fnArial\fs30}The emperor of the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.19,0:34:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你认为可以捉到他 那你才有麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you think you're going after him, you're the one who's in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.83,0:34:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许吧 但不是他就是他的属下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps, but it's either him or someone in his organization.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.63,0:34:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来如此 你以为能从我这儿得到线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see. And you figured you could charm the dirt out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.04,0:34:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那不是我的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. That wasn't my plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.91,0:34:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 如果要我在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Because if it comes to a choice…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.41,0:34:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们之中选择 我已做了抉择\N{\fnArial\fs30}between you and Elliot, I've made my bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.84,0:34:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已被三振出局\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't sleep in it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.18,0:34:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来你在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.25,0:34:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.45,0:34:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到处找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been looking everywhere for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.59,0:34:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让你见见林葳 她在新华社工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to meet Wai Lin, New China News Agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.93,0:34:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 卡佛太太 很荣幸认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Mrs. Carver. It's a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.76,0:34:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.30,0:34:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你们认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't realize you knew each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.97,0:34:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们是老朋友 - 泛泛之交\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're old friends. - Casual acquaintances.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.94,0:34:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在苏黎世时是我室友的男友\N{\fnArial\fs30}He dated my roommate in Zurich.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.87,0:34:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想雇用林葳小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking of getting Wai Lin behind a news desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.71,0:34:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那太好了 我想她一定不会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's wonderful. I'm sure she won't resist…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.18,0:34:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,拒绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.65,0:35:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 我在想着关于你的卫星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, Elliot, I was just wondering about your satellites…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.22,0:35:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在全球部署的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}the way you've positioned yourself globally.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.79,0:35:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们只是用来广播资讯\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're merely tools for information, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.89,0:35:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,也可能是虚假资讯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or disinformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.56,0:35:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,例如 你能用卫星去干扰政府或人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say, if you wanted to manipulate the course of governments or people.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.00,0:35:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至是一艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or even a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.97,0:35:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有趣 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's very interesting, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.97,0:35:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为一个银行家 你的想像力非常丰富\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a vivid imagination for a banker.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.71,0:35:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我该委任你写小说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps I should commission you to write a novel.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.25,0:35:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我会迷失在大海中 漂流\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, heavens, no. I'd be lost at sea. Adrift.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.59,0:35:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,开幕的时间到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to begin the festivities.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.89,0:35:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪一下 亲爱的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Darling?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.47,0:35:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么认识他的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how do you really know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.67,0:35:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已说了 他是个银行家 我们在苏黎世认识的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, he's a banker. I met him in Zurich.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.77,0:35:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说谎的技巧很差\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a terrible liar, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.68,0:36:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看那个银行家不顺眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a problem with a banker.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.08,0:36:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可否跟我来一下？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could I see you a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.88,0:36:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位先生女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.72,0:36:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡佛先生十分钟后 会在大厅开始致词\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Carver's broadcast will be starting in ten minutes in the main studio.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.36,0:36:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你擅长哪方面的银行业务？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly what kind of banking do you specialize in, Mr. Bond?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.37,0:36:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌意收购 我们走吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hostile takeovers. Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.28,0:36:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡佛在这里一定感觉像在家一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carver must feel at home in a room like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.25,0:36:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,能够对着全世界说话真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nice to talk to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.69,0:36:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来有人想跟你谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like there's someone who wants to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.83,0:36:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生 你有一通紧急电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Bond, you have an urgent phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.94,0:36:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 五秒后现场播出 五\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, we are live in five…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.24,0:37:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,四 三 二…\N{\fnArial\fs30}four, three, two…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.71,0:37:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.71,0:37:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚的广播应该是个庆典\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight's broadcast was supposed to be a celebration…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.52,0:37:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,显示卡佛全球卫星网络的完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}marking the completion of the Carver Global Satellite Network.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.35,0:37:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, as you're well aware…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.99,0:37:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,南中国海出现冲突\N{\fnArial\fs30}a terrible conflict looms tonight in the South China Sea…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.16,0:37:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不加制止的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}which, unchecked…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.93,0:37:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能会毁灭地球上每一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}has the potential to destroy every human being on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.73,0:37:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想向观众保证 我… 这边请\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to assure my viewers that I… This way, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.40,0:37:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾利欧卡佛跟英首相…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elliot Carver, have spoken with the prime minister in London…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.84,0:37:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,及在北京的主席谈过\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the chairman in Beijing…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.84,0:37:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,提出我作为不偏不倚的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and have offered my services as an impartial…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.38,0:37:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这房间有隔音设备 没人会听到你的叫声\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a soundproof room, Mr. Bond. Nobody hears you scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.76,0:37:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,史丹博 我们已接头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Herr Stamper, we have made contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.33,0:37:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好对付他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make him uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.93,0:37:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我待会儿就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be there in a few moments.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.30,0:38:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,24小时刊印新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with its printing presses that run 24 hours a day…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.77,0:38:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫星联系每一个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and its satellite facilities linking every last…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.04,0:38:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好像很关心卡佛先生的生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem very concerned about Mr. Carver's business.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.75,0:38:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想知道原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants to know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.65,0:38:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们问我为何这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did I do it, you ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.05,0:38:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,答案很简单 权力\N{\fnArial\fs30}The answer is simple: power.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.45,0:38:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,启发地球偏远地区的人权力\N{\fnArial\fs30}The power to illuminate the far corners of the globe.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.33,0:38:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不为利润\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for higher profits…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.33,0:38:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是促进人与人之间的了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}but for higher understanding between the people of this great planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.87,0:38:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他坐在椅子上 我们在他头上玩点把戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put him in the chair. Maybe we play a little number on his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.91,0:38:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想得到什么回报？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what do I expect in return?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.48,0:38:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,支配全球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worldwide domination.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.25,0:38:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,完完全全 彻底的支配全球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Complete, utter, total worldwide domination.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.48,0:38:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不是凌驾政府或意识形态\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not over governments or ideology.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.82,0:38:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是凌驾暴政 隔绝及无知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over tyranny and isolation and ignorance.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.96,0:39:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡佛媒体集团有能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Carver Media Group Network has the ability…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.63,0:39:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,接触每一个人 在每个村庄 每个国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}to reach every person in every village in every nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.80,0:39:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但别感到害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}But do not fear me…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.87,0:39:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今晚提出的原则宣言\N{\fnArial\fs30}for tonight I offer you my declaration of principles:
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.51,0:39:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,承诺地球上每一个男女\N{\fnArial\fs30}A promise to the men and women of this planet…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.81,0:39:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所服务的兄弟姐妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}my brothers and sisters whom I so humbly serve.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.18,0:39:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不偏不倚 没有恐惧的报导新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise to report the news without fear or favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.55,0:39:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我承诺作为这世上的善良力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise to be a force for good in this world…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.19,0:39:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,反抗不公正 压倒偏执\N{\fnArial\fs30}fighting injustice, crushing intolerance…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.86,0:39:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,向不人道宣战\N{\fnArial\fs30}battling inhumanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.19,0:39:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,该是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time for…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.06,0:39:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,广播中断的时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}a station break.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.60,0:39:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？我们失去了电力\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening? We've lost power.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.61,0:39:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,广播中断 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're off the air. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.71,0:39:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 请保持冷静 不用离去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, please stay calm. There's no need to go for the exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.75,0:40:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,几分钟后会恢复电力\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will go on in a few minutes' time.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.22,0:40:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思 你不知道？你被开除了！滚！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, you don't know? You're fired! Get out of my sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.77,0:40:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,颇令人尴尬的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, in a rather embarrassing note…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.77,0:40:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好战的媒体巨子 卡佛今晚在全球的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}scrappy media mogul Elliot Carver was cut off the air tonight…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.48,0:40:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫星网络首播致词时\N{\fnArial\fs30}in mid-speech during the inaugural broadcast…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.98,0:41:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,被半途中断\N{\fnArial\fs30}of his Worldwide Satellite Network.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.95,0:41:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 艾利欧 不是我们做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Elliot, but we didn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.82,0:41:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,很光彩的晚上 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glorious evening, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.36,0:41:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管那些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Elliot. Ignore those people.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.69,0:41:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这种事常常会发生 - 不会在我身上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sometimes these things happen. - Not to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.46,0:41:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会在我身上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.61,0:41:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我16岁时在香港一间报社工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was 16, I went to work for a newspaper in Hong Kong.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.44,0:41:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是间小报社 但编辑教导了我最重要的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a rag, but the editor taught me one important lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.35,0:41:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,出色的报导 关键不在于人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}The key to a great story is not who…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.59,0:41:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,内容或时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}or what or when…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.49,0:41:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}but why.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.16,0:41:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的朋友邦德先生把今晚搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friend, Mr. Bond, made a mess tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.67,0:41:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想知道原因 - 我已说了 我跟他是泛泛之交\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I want to know why. - I told you, I barely know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.67,0:42:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,泛泛之交？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barely?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.53,0:42:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在好奇卡佛先生会派谁来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was curious who Carver would send.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.77,0:42:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要对付你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's on to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.77,0:42:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都知道你站在谁那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we know where you stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.01,0:42:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已做了抉择\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made your bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.05,0:42:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正站在你的房门口\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm standing in your doorway.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.52,0:42:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以转身回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then turn around and go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.53,0:42:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他从我这儿套不出什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can tell him you didn't get anything out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.80,0:43:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样？回家去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it? Go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.07,0:43:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并没有要你牵涉这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't ask you to get involved in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.94,0:43:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too late for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.68,0:43:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何要嫁给他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you marry him?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.68,0:43:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told me he loved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.72,0:43:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话很中听\N{\fnArial\fs30}That always sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.56,0:43:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾每天看报纸找你的仆闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know I used to look in the papers every day for your obituary?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.56,0:43:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我令你失望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm sorry I keep disappointing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.94,0:43:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底是为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was it, James?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.41,0:43:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太接近吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I get too close?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.95,0:43:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,近到让你不舒服？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I get too close for comfort?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.27,0:44:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.42,0:44:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想念你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.96,0:45:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你查到什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you find?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.89,0:45:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我骇入银行的电脑 他们在使用SSL2…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hacked into the mainframe at the bank. They're using an SSL2 encryption…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.26,0:45:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,省掉这段高科技词汇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spare me the technobabble, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.67,0:45:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德有完美的受雇记录 十年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond's got a perfect employment record. Ten years.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.34,0:45:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他做事非常小心谨慎\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's crossed every "T, " he's dotted every "I."
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.87,0:45:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么意思？- 是政府的情报员\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Which means? - Government agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.11,0:45:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我称之为古达创意异例定律\N{\fnArial\fs30}I call it Gupta's Law of Creative Anomalies.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.08,0:45:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是毫无破绽的 定有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it sounds too good to be true, it always is.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.58,0:45:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为我老婆知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think my wife knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.29,0:45:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,太多杂音 但若调低四周的声音…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a lot of garbage, but if you dial down the ambient noise…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.89,0:45:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你睡觉时仍将枪放在枕头下吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, James, do you still sleep with a gun under your pillow?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.53,0:45:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Play it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.97,0:45:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你睡觉时仍将枪放在枕头下吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, James, do you still sleep with a gun under your pillow?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.74,0:45:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想该安排她跟医生见面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we should set an appointment for my wife with the doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.19,0:46:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我必须走了 不 - 你不必\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have to go. - No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.56,0:46:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以让你在四小时内 离开这个国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can get you out of the country in four hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.87,0:46:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.80,0:46:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人可以保护我免遭他毒手 连你都不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one can protect me from him, not even you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.30,0:46:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有选择 - 除非你放过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You do have a choice. - Only if you let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.21,0:46:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我办不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.21,0:46:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在顶层有个秘密实验室 甚至连我都不应该知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has a secret lab on the top floor even I'm not supposed to know about.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.68,0:46:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,在屋顶有个紧急天窗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an emergency hatch on the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.69,0:46:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不必告诉我 - 那是最容易进去的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't have to do this. - It's the easiest way to get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.02,0:46:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟我争辩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't argue with me, James.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.93,0:46:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.30,0:46:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的这个工作…\N{\fnArial\fs30}this job of yours…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.13,0:46:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个感情上的致命武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's murder on relationships.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.25,0:48:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在的这段时间 派两个人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until I get back next week, I want two guards…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.25,0:48:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天24小时在外面守卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}outside this office 24 hours a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.72,0:48:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁也不能够进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody gets in. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.66,0:48:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.90,0:48:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫星怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do with the satellite?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.10,0:48:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,送到发射站 小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send this thing off to the launch site. And be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.97,0:48:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,它值三亿元 你打破了它 你就要买下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's worth 300 million dollars. You break it, you bought it. Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.27,0:48:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌旅行 从来都不知道要打包什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate travelling. I never know what to pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.61,0:50:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,在找寻新的题材吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking for a news story?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.24,0:52:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他们什么都印\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll print anything these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.41,0:53:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪位？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.17,0:53:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安 邦德先生 我是卡佛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, Mr. Bond. Elliot Carver.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.18,0:53:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你拿走两件属于我的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you've got two items that belong to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.55,0:53:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.65,0:53:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,红色的盒子 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}The red box, Mr. Bond…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.72,0:53:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我老婆在你饭店的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my wife in your hotel room.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.10,0:54:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.84,0:54:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,指纹身分已被确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fingerprint I.D. accepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.75,0:54:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,请选择保全程度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please select security system level.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.38,0:54:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你如果找到编码器便通知我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me if you find the encoder.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.38,0:54:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 立刻打电话给我 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Call me immediately. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.90,0:55:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,最新消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in breaking news…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.10,0:55:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们伤心的宣布 帕莉丝卡佛的死讯\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is with great sadness that we announce the death of Paris Carver…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.20,0:55:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她自成为卡佛太太后\N{\fnArial\fs30}who has become an international figure since she became the wife…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.91,0:55:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,名闻国际\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Elliot Carver, chairman of this network.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.51,0:55:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,德国汉堡警方表示\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to police officials in Hamburg, Germany…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.48,0:55:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,她今早被发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Carver was found dead this morning…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.48,0:55:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒毙在饭店套房 死因异常\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a hotel suite in that city in unusual circumstances…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.02,0:55:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方拒绝进一步透露详情\N{\fnArial\fs30}on which police have refused to elaborate.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.72,0:55:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,法医验尸在三天后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}A coroner has been called for and is expected to deliver…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.52,0:55:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有全面报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}his full report within the next three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.99,0:55:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,她身旁有一个不知名男子的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her body was discovered along with the body of an unidentified man…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.80,0:55:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信他是吞枪自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}who appeared to be the victim of a self-inflicted gun wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.03,0:55:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他的私人飞机上联络到他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reached aboard his private jet en route…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.40,0:55:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经瞄准你的头 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a clear shot at your head, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.51,0:55:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢的站起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand up, slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.48,0:56:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,扔下枪将它踢过来给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop your gun and kick it toward me, ja?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.05,0:56:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方拒绝猜测…\N{\fnArial\fs30}At present, police have refused to speculate…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.55,0:56:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这宗杀人跟自杀的动机\N{\fnArial\fs30}on a motive in this murder/suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.95,0:56:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 现在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Now…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.85,0:56:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,躺在卡佛太太身旁\N{\fnArial\fs30}lie down on the bed next to Mrs. Carver.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.66,0:56:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们向卡佛先生致深切慰问\N{\fnArial\fs30}We extend our deepest sympathies to Mr. Carver.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.50,0:56:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一小时后会有报导\N{\fnArial\fs30}This story will be on the news in an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.27,0:56:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 今天的明日报新闻 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tomorrow's news today. - Just so.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.08,0:56:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是高夫曼医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Dr. Kaufman.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.51,0:56:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一名出色的神枪手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am an outstanding pistol marksman.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.98,0:56:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,请相信我 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take my word for it, ja?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.26,0:56:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿长柄大锤过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the sledgehammers.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.74,0:57:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很奋力的反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She struggled terribly, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.47,0:57:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该将她牵涉入此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a pity you got her involved in all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.61,0:57:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从那儿开枪杀我就不像是自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't look like a suicide if you shoot me from over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.35,0:57:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是法医学教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a professor of forensic medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.12,0:57:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 就算我从远方射杀你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, Mr. Bond, I could shoot you from Stuttgart…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.75,0:57:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,也可以有自杀的效果\N{\fnArial\fs30}and still create the proper effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.43,0:57:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的技术很受欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}My art is in great demand, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.50,0:57:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界各地都有人雇用我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I go all over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.57,0:57:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我擅长使名人服食过量药物死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am especially good at the celebrity overdose.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.07,0:57:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但恐怕我们的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now, I'm afraid, Mr. Bond, that our little…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.65,0:57:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,史丹博 别在我的耳朵大叫 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stamper! Stop yelling in my ear, ja?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.82,0:57:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们打不开车门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, they can't get into the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.29,0:57:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是认真的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.99,0:57:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,有找过汽车拖吊所吗？你要打电话给他们吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you call the Auto Club? Do you want to call them?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.76,0:57:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,逼他说出如何打开车门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make him tell you how to open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.76,0:57:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我来问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.63,0:58:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真难为情\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is very embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.67,0:58:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像有个红盒子在你车上\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems there is a red box in your car.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.97,0:58:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们无法打开车门\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't get to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.90,0:58:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要我逼你打开车门\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want me to make you unlock the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.91,0:58:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉像个白痴 不知道应该说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like an idiot. I don't know what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.15,0:58:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你不听话 我就折磨你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am to torture you if you don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.48,0:58:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你也是这方面的博士？- 不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You've a doctorate in that too? - No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.82,0:58:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,算是个嗜好 但我很有天分\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is more like a hobby. But I'm very gifted.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.79,0:58:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.06,0:58:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的手机可以打开车门 - 不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My cell phone opens the car. - No, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.06,0:58:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do it, ja?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.70,0:58:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,重拨 再按三 然后送出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recall, three, send.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.22,0:58:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.75,0:58:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是职业杀手 只是收钱办事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just a professional doing a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.49,0:58:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.05,0:59:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,高夫曼医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Kaufman.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.02,1:00:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎 请系上安全带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome. Please fasten seat belt.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.53,1:00:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,减速\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reduce speed.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.90,1:00:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,有行人在路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pedestrians in roadway.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.90,1:01:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,司机请小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Driver alert.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.10,1:01:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,前面有障碍 请马上减速\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obstruction ahead. Reduce speed now.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.91,1:02:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,请注意 鲁莽驾驶将使保证无效\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reminder: Unsafe driving will void warranty.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.83,1:03:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你一路平安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations on a safe journey.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.77,1:03:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,南中国海美国空军基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}U.S. Air Base, South China Sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.29,1:04:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo! Jimbo!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.53,1:04:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦德 你为什么会在这里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wade, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.63,1:04:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我是四海为家的 走这边吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the world's my office. Let's go this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.70,1:04:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Q博士有跟你解释清楚吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did Q bring you up to speed?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.70,1:04:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,有 我已经带了 全球定位卫星的校准仪器来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I brought along the G.P.S. calibration unit.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.74,1:04:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便跟你提一下 正式来说 美国在这次行动是中立的\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, officially Uncle Sam is completely neutral in this turkey shoot.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.57,1:04:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,非正式呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And unofficially?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.04,1:04:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非是美国先开战 否则我们不希望看到世界大战\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have no interest in seeing World War Three, unless we start it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.25,1:04:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,格林渥特博士是定位卫星的专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Greenwalt. He's the Air Force G.P.S. expert.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.68,1:04:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 保安那么严密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about all this security…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.68,1:04:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,定位卫星的编码器…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the G.P.S. encoder is one of the most closely guarded secrets…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.02,1:04:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是美国军方的最高机密\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the U.S. military.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.52,1:04:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他看看你有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show him what you got.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.73,1:04:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天 这是失去了的编码器 你怎样拿到的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, it's the missing encoder. How the hell did you get that?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.73,1:04:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天早上在汉堡找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Picked it up in Hamburg yesterday morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.40,1:04:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,它可以使船舰偏离航道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could somebody use this to send a ship off course?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.84,1:04:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你指的是得文夏号？- 别瞎猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like the Devonshire? - Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.44,1:04:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人说过得文夏号 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't you hear anybody mention the Devonshire. Did you?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.71,1:04:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是 - 那你快回答他的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Good, so just answer his question.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.75,1:04:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,理论上 如果你能影响计时芯片\N{\fnArial\fs30}In theory, if you could alter the timing chip…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.31,1:04:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就可以使船舰偏离航道\N{\fnArial\fs30}you could slowly send a ship off course.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.82,1:05:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好像在指南针旁边放置磁铁 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like putting a magnet near a compass. - Yeah, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.89,1:05:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你检查一下这个 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then check this out. Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.20,1:05:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这两个圆圈是应该重叠的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those two circles should be lining up on top of each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.81,1:05:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人曾经改动过编码器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody's tampered with your encoder.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.58,1:05:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果知道得文夏号 最后显示的时间和位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we knew the last time and position the Devonshire thought she was…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.88,1:05:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能够找出它沉没的地点吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}could you figure out exactly where she sank?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.72,1:05:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.92,1:05:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wade…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.39,1:05:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要请你帮个小忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a small favor to ask.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.56,1:05:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,高空起跳 低空张伞…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The high-altitude, low opening jump… the HALO jump…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.57,1:05:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是最易致命的 所以请听清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}is where we get the most fatalities, so listen up.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.84,1:05:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自由下降五英里和要使用氧气 否则你会窒息而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You free-fall for 5 miles and use your oxygen, or you'll die of asphyxiation.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.21,1:05:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我的第一段婚姻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like my first marriage.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.58,1:05:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,自由下降之后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}After the free-fall…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.94,1:06:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,在离地二百尺时打开降落伞 那能避开中国的雷达\N{\fnArial\fs30}pop the chute at 200 feet, below the Chinese radar.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.68,1:06:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的时速将会超过二百英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be traveling at over 200 miles an hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.68,1:06:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,风力随时能扭断你的脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}This snaps your head back like a cantaloupe.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.68,1:06:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,头部别撞到氧气筒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't crack your skull open on the tanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.32,1:06:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会紧记着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll keep that in mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.99,1:06:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后 当你到达水面 就马上切断降落伞\N{\fnArial\fs30}One last thing: When you hit the water don't forget to cut away your chute.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.79,1:06:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,百分之九十进行这种跳法的人 都被降落伞缠着而溺毙\N{\fnArial\fs30}90% of people killed in the HALO jump got tangled in their chutes and drowned.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.46,1:06:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.76,1:06:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了拯救世界 要做的事情可真不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems like a lot just to save the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.03,1:06:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有别的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got no choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.70,1:06:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要证明军舰是被故意引离航道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to prove that ship was deliberately set off course.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.87,1:06:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}One minute!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.17,1:06:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安排好接应了吗？- 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is the pickup set? - You bet.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.14,1:06:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,完成任务之后就把无线电开着 我们会来接应你\N{\fnArial\fs30}After your mission, turn on your beacon. The extraction team will pick you up.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.21,1:06:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛祖保佑！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddha bless!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.62,1:06:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我刚刚发现… - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I just noticed something. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.99,1:06:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是军舰误认的地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where the ship thought it was.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.72,1:06:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是军舰真正的地点 看到这个岛吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where it really is. But see that island?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.19,1:06:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到 他将要降落的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. That means where he's jumping…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.63,1:06:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚好在英国跟中国的舰队中间\N{\fnArial\fs30}between the British and Chinese fleets…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.36,1:06:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,严格来说 这里不是中国的领海\N{\fnArial\fs30}Technically they're not in Chinese territorial waters.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.73,1:06:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这里其实是越南的领海 - 越南的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They belong to Vietnam. - Vietnam?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.44,1:07:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他身上有美国政府的标记吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does he have any U.S. government markings on him?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.71,1:07:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,降落伞 潜水衣 蛙鞋全都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}The parachute, the wet suit, the fins.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.87,1:07:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果越南人捉到他 他们会发疯的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the Vietnamese catch him, they're gonna go crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.42,1:07:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他连再见也没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't even say good-bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.14,1:11:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,对敌意收购有兴趣吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still interested in hostile takeovers?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.08,1:11:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最喜欢当银行家可以到处旅行\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the opportunities for travel that I like best about banking.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.29,1:11:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,开过来这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring the boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.89,1:11:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还在等什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.84,1:12:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,带他们上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get them out of the water.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.19,1:12:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是不知道 还以为你在跟踪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I didn't know better, I'd say you were following me around, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.96,1:12:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也得承认…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have to admit, though…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.99,1:12:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们似乎发展了 密不可分的关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}we seem to have developed a certain attachment to each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.20,1:12:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望只是暂时的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hopefully not for long.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.07,1:12:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一幢卡佛的大厦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another Carver building.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.74,1:12:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是不知道 我还以为 他开发了一整片的摩天大厦\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I didn't know better, I'd say he'd developed an edifice complex.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.93,1:13:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 张将军？- 你的朋友？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- General Chang? - Friend of yours?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.47,1:13:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生 林小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Bond. Miss Lin.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.77,1:13:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到西贡市\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Saigon.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.37,1:13:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,真高兴又看到你 艾利欧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's always nice to see you, Elliot.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.21,1:13:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备在明天启用这幢大厦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hadn't intended opening this center until tomorrow…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.98,1:13:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在来到 刚好可以帮我写开幕故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}but as you're here you can help me to write the inaugural story…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.92,1:13:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你的仆文\N{\fnArial\fs30}your obituaries.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.62,1:13:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你对帕莉丝也这么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you extended the same courtesy to Paris.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.29,1:13:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实当你叫我已故的太太 出卖我时…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, Mr. Bond, you're the one who wrote my late wife's obituary…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.73,1:13:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经为她写了仆文\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you asked her to betray me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.17,1:13:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 让我们看看…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still, let's see…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.80,1:13:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,「英国情报员詹姆斯邦德」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"British secret service agent James Bond…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.97,1:13:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,「跟中国情报员」\N{\fnArial\fs30}and his collaborator Wai Lin…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.14,1:13:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,「林葳小姐」\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the Chinese People's External Security Force…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.14,1:13:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,「在今天早晨」\N{\fnArial\fs30}were found…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.51,1:13:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,「被发现…」\N{\fnArial\fs30}dead this morning…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.85,1:13:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,「死于越南」\N{\fnArial\fs30}in Vietnam."
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.45,1:13:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,太平淡了 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lacks punch, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.65,1:13:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这已不是新闻 我跟她合作几个月了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's old news, Elliot. We've been working together for months.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.72,1:14:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们两国政府都知道 你跟张将军的勾当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both our governments know what you and General Chang are up to.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.63,1:14:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.63,1:14:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也许在走廊看到张将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may have seen the general in the hallway just now…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.97,1:14:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你们可能太忙吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}but perhaps, with all your jetting around…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.20,1:14:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,未看到今天的头条新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've not had chance to peruse today's headlines.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.51,1:14:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最喜欢这一句 这还不是我的报纸呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I rather like the last one. It isn't even mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.35,1:14:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从不相信报纸的新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never believe what I read in the press anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.52,1:14:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你的问题 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. Therein lies your problem, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.72,1:14:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都是能干的人 但你跟林小姐的时代已成过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're both men of action, but your era and Miss Lin's is passing.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.26,1:14:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 文字就是力量 卫星就是武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Words are the new weapons, satellites the new artillery.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.44,1:14:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你就是世界联盟的最高统帅？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you become the new supreme allied commander?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.07,1:14:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全对！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.50,1:14:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯撒跟拿破仑都有自己的军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar had his legions, Napoleon had his armies…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.57,1:14:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我也有我的队伍… 电视 报纸 杂志\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have my divisions… TV, news, magazines.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.51,1:14:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,到今晚午夜 收听到我广播的人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And by midnight I'll have reached and influenced more people…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.74,1:14:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,将是前所未见的多 除了上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}than anyone in the history of this planet, save God Himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.25,1:15:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算上帝也只是在山上讲道罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the best He ever managed was the Sermon on the Mount.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.25,1:15:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really are quite insane.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.36,1:15:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯子跟天才的差别…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The distance between insanity and genius…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.19,1:15:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不过是成功与失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}is measured only by success.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.19,1:15:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.33,1:15:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,张将军在等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}General Chang is waiting.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.97,1:15:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'll forgive me,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.97,1:15:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的出现逼得我 得把时间表提早一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}your appearance here has forced me…to move up my timetable slightly.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.80,1:15:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将你们 交给史丹博跟他的玩具处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll leave you in the capable hands of Mr. Stamper and his toys.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.54,1:15:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你们想看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you'd like to see them.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.28,1:15:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,直升机正在等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir. The helicopter.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.84,1:15:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 古达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Gupta.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.21,1:15:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,已故的史丹博是 高夫曼医生的徒弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Stamper is a protege of the late Dr. Kaufman…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.35,1:15:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,高夫曼医生教授他 古代的折磨艺术\N{\fnArial\fs30}who was schooling him in the ancient art of chakra torture.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.59,1:15:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就像我的父亲一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was like a father to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.59,1:15:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？很有趣的榜样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Interesting role model.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.83,1:15:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据东方的哲学 人体有七个要穴\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to Eastern philosophy, the body has seven chakra points.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.00,1:15:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们是身体的能量中心 例如心脏或是性器官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Energy centers, like the heart or genitals.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.30,1:15:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些工具是用来刺进那些器官的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The purpose of these implements is to probe those organs…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.70,1:15:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,让痛苦达到极限\N{\fnArial\fs30}inflicting the maximum amount of pain…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.97,1:15:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,而又能让受害者存活久一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}whilst keeping the victim alive for as long as possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.21,1:15:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,高夫曼的纪录是52小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Kaufman's record was 52 hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.54,1:16:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望能打破它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hoping to break it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.65,1:16:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为看你的节目已是虐待了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. I would've thought watching your TV shows was torture enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.75,1:16:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个留到最后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save this one till last.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.25,1:16:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你拿出邦德的心脏时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you remove Mr. Bond's heart…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.39,1:16:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该还有时间 让他看着自己的心脏停止跳动\N{\fnArial\fs30}there should be just enough time for him to watch it stop beating.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.66,1:16:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.92,1:16:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.90,1:16:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能利用大型海报\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can use the banner.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.87,1:17:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望可以支撑得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope it holds.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.14,1:17:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快去追他们 - 准备好没有？走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get after them! - Ready? Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.00,1:17:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次我会搭电梯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time I'll take the elevator.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.71,1:17:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,用力推…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Push! Push!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.60,1:18:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找部车来 - 不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get a car! - No, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.17,1:18:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 找车 - 摩托车快一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, a car! - A bike is quicker.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.97,1:18:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,有钥匙 总是有人忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}The keys. Someone always forgets them.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.97,1:18:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？我来骑 下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? I'm driving. Get off.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.01,1:18:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你坐后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get on the back.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.51,1:18:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在滑下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm slipping.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.08,1:18:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,别在后面动来动去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop fidgeting back there.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.09,1:18:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.99,1:18:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我另一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me that.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.56,1:18:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,离合器…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clutch! Clutch! Clutch!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.73,1:18:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 右转 - 不 左转\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Turn right. - No, left.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.36,1:18:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁在骑？快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's driving? Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.16,1:19:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,离合器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clutch!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.37,1:19:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,左转…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left! Left!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.97,1:19:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,后面有多少车跟来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many back there?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.68,1:19:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不到 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't see. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.45,1:19:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you… What?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.25,1:19:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别想歪 - 我没想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't get any ideas. - I'd never dream of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.62,1:19:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,一台…不 两台\N{\fnArial\fs30}One… No, two.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.13,1:19:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,利用那些桶子 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go for the barrels. What?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.30,1:19:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very good.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.19,1:20:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.40,1:20:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's take the highway.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.69,1:20:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有直升机 - 好 别太兴奋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Helicopter! - All right, keep your shirt on.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.34,1:21:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到后座去 - 你想要保护我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get on the back of the bike. - Are you trying to protect me?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.48,1:21:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我需要平衡摩托车 到后座去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I need to balance the bike. Get on the back.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.62,1:21:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备好了吗？- 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You ready? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.49,1:21:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.17,1:22:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开离合器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pop the clutch.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.83,1:22:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在我们后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's behind us.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.04,1:22:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快让开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.67,1:22:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.54,1:23:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到直升机吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see the chopper?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.68,1:23:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不到 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't see. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.02,1:23:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.56,1:23:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被困住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trapped.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.37,1:23:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.62,1:24:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能拿肥皂给我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you pass the soap?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.02,1:24:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over there.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.16,1:24:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你甩钩子的技巧不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were pretty good with that hook.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.80,1:24:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我出身恶劣的居住环境\N{\fnArial\fs30}It comes from growing up in a rough neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.10,1:24:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你骑摩托车的技术不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were pretty good on the bike.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.44,1:24:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我从没长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that comes from not growing up at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.41,1:24:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里 让我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Allow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.38,1:24:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动歪脑筋 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get any ideas, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.41,1:24:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想起来 我们或可联手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just off the cuff, I thought we might link up.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.18,1:25:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,携手合作？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Work hand in hand?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.69,1:25:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼此更接近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stick closer to each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.16,1:25:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们可一起对付张将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we go after General Chang together.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.19,1:25:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.96,1:25:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你帮我洗头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for washing my hair.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.23,1:25:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢独自行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I work alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.88,1:27:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好我刚好经过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky for you I stopped by.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.89,1:27:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本可以自己解决他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could've taken care of him.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.62,1:27:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hmm. But you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.83,1:27:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,耳环给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the earring.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.60,1:28:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,中国军方标准用枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy of a Makarov 59. Standard issue, Chinese Army.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.77,1:28:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来张将军想杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like General Chang wants you dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.90,1:28:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你仍认为你能独自行动？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still think you can do this alone?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.14,1:28:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那要看你的任务是和平的 或是想报复\N{\fnArial\fs30}It depends whether your mission is peace or revenge.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.68,1:28:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的任务是要制止战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is about stopping a war.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.65,1:28:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,去年我们发现一些隐形材料…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last year we found stealth material was missing…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.29,1:28:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,在张将军的基地失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}from one of General Chang's bases.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.62,1:28:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我追查线索到卡佛的汉堡总部\N{\fnArial\fs30}I followed a lead to Carver's headquarters in Hamburg.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.16,1:28:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,隐形材料？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stealth material?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.83,1:28:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以为他要做隐形飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thought he was building a stealth plane.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.30,1:28:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 是一艘隐形船\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Stealth boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.03,1:28:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他们 唯一能接近得文夏号的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the only way they could get close to the Devonshire…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.14,1:28:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们才能钻开导弹室\N{\fnArial\fs30}so they could drill inside the missile room.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.54,1:28:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得吗？他们偷走了军舰上的导弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember? They stole a cruise missile from that ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.41,1:28:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说将时间表提前到午夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he was moving the timetable forward to midnight.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.38,1:28:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 他当然会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course he did.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.51,1:28:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会利用黑夜 将船停靠在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Under cover of darkness he'll position the stealth boat…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.85,1:28:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,接近英国舰队的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}near the British fleet…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.65,1:28:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后向中国发射导弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}fire the missile into China.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.35,1:29:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如此我们两国就会展开报复 - 卡佛就能大肆报导\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And we will retaliate. - And Carver will provide the pictures.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.09,1:29:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我必须警告北京 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have to warn Beijing. - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.03,1:29:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,警告中英双方政府 让他们去谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's warn both our governments, get them talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.60,1:29:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我们就有时间能找到船\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll give us time to find the boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.43,1:29:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,站起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand up.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.09,1:29:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有家的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. It's just like home.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.19,1:29:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你提供设备 那就我来发信\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get the equipment, I'll send the messages.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.40,1:29:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,再仔细想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}On second thought…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.90,1:29:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是你来打字好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you type.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.23,1:29:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 我们得先找到船\N{\fnArial\fs30}First we find the boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.57,1:29:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,归属张将军管辖的 所有港口跟海口…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of all the harbors and inlets controlled by General Chang…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.31,1:29:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,有22点人口密集地区\N{\fnArial\fs30}22 are in highly populated areas.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.28,1:29:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下14点能让他藏匿隐形船\N{\fnArial\fs30}That leaves 14 where he could hide a stealth boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.98,1:29:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,白天一定能看到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can see it during the day.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.98,1:30:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷达探测不到 但肉眼一定能看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's invisible to radar, but not the human eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.49,1:30:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常新奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very novel.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.66,1:30:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定将船藏在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd have to hide it someplace…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.93,1:30:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,能在一晚内往返得文夏号的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}where he could sail to the Devonshire and back in one night.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.96,1:30:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个看起来好熟悉\N{\fnArial\fs30}This looks familiar.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.30,1:30:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们做了一些改良\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've made some improvements.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.00,1:30:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you, indeed?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.17,1:30:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 往返共八小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Four hours out and four hours back.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.44,1:30:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以假设船速三十海里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's assume the boat is traveling at a speed of 30 knots.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.75,1:30:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一向都很崇拜中国的科技\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always been a fan of Chinese technology.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.95,1:30:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据电脑显示\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to this…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.82,1:30:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,有四个地方能让他停靠那艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}there are four places where he could harbor the boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.59,1:30:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心你的左边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up on your left.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.46,1:30:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,查询看看那个地区有无可疑之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run a cross check on those areas for anything suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.60,1:30:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,新型华特枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, the new Walther.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.80,1:30:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已跟Q博士要求一支\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked Q for one of these.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.75,1:31:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了 你来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got it. Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.39,1:31:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,四艘船失踪 三艘因不明原因下沉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four missing boats. Three unexplained drownings.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.19,1:31:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一定就是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That has to be it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.53,1:31:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈隆湾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha Long Bay.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.28,1:31:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对那个岛很了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows the island.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.82,1:31:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说在黄昏时 船只驶近那里会很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says that it's dangerous for boats to be around there at sunset…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.75,1:31:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但为了五千元美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}but for 5, 000 American dollars…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.92,1:31:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会带我们去\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'll take us.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.42,1:31:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.69,1:31:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许他愿意收支票\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he'll take a check.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.61,1:32:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个沉闷的例行公事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's mostly dull routine, of course…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.11,1:32:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但偶而能有机会 在迷人的黄昏出海\N{\fnArial\fs30}but every now and then you get to sail on a beautiful evening like this…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.12,1:32:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时跟腐败的 西方势力的情报员合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sometimes work with a decadent agent of a corrupt Western power.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.59,1:32:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都说共产主义者不懂享乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they say Communists don't know how to have fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.02,1:32:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想让你感到失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate to disappoint you…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.09,1:32:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我连毛语录都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I don't even have a little red book.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.10,1:32:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我有不测\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anything happens to me…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.10,1:32:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,水雷的引线在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}the fuses for the mines are in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.77,1:32:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会一起完成任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna finish this together.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.87,1:32:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我可以这么说的话 你找到了一位…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I may say so, you found the right…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.91,1:32:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,合适的腐败的西方情报员…\N{\fnArial\fs30}decadent, corrupt Western agent…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.45,1:32:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,为工作伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}as a partner.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.44,1:33:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看到隐形船了吗？- 还没\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See the stealth? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.64,1:33:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,越来越晚了 这是附近最后一个海湾\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's getting late and this is the last cove in the bay.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.62,1:33:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.98,1:33:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,设定时间十分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set the timers for ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.45,1:33:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该有足够时间 让我们在船爆炸之前离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll give us time to get out of here before the ship explodes.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.52,1:33:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算它没沉也会显示在雷达上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if it doesn't sink, it'll show up on radar.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.29,1:34:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的舰队会完成工作 如果他们有收到我们发出的信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our fleets will finish the job. If they got our message.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.29,1:34:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上去 移到那边 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you, up and over. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.11,1:34:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已在舰队之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in position between the fleets.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.15,1:34:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,向双方舰队旗舰各发射一枚导弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire one missile at the flagship of each fleet.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.35,1:34:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,中国会以为英国耀武扬威\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Chinese will think the British are rattling the saber…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.32,1:34:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,而英国会以为中国好战\N{\fnArial\fs30}the British will think the Chinese are being belligerent…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:35.09,1:34:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这时媒体就可提供 精彩客观的报导\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the media will provide cool, objective coverage.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.13,1:34:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始破坏行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let the mayhem begin.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.91,1:34:53.31,Note,0,0,0,0,,（英国舰队皇家比德福号）
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.51,1:34:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,被导弹锁定目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missile lock-on.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.88,1:34:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,通知海军总部：「特遣舰队受到导弹攻击」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send a signal to the Admiralty: "Task group under missile attack."
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.92,1:35:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,警报控制系统报告有米格21号机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, AWACS reports two waves of land-based MIG 21s inbound.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.72,1:35:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一批将在两分钟内 出现在雷达荧幕上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first group should be on our screens in two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.06,1:35:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有多久米格机就会在 英国舰队射程范围内？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long before the MiGs are within firing range of the British fleet?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.36,1:35:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,12分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twelve minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.00,1:35:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我雇用你来干嘛的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell do I pay you for?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.50,1:35:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她在那里 邦德也在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she's there, Bond is there.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.47,1:35:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,史丹博 去找他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stamper, find them.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.88,1:35:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,林葳…有摄影机！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wai Lin! Wai Lin! Camera!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.89,1:35:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她敢动一下 就杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she blinks, kill her.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.89,1:35:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.67,1:36:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,史丹博呼叫驾驶台 邦德已死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stamper to Bridge. Bond is dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.04,1:36:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delicious.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.51,1:36:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,要确保清除所有的水雷 将那个女的带来见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure you clear all the mines, and bring the girl up to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.32,1:36:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定要带她上来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure you want her up here?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.32,1:36:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my business, Mr. Gupta.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.33,1:36:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢有观众\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like an audience.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.10,1:37:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,林小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, Miss Lin.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.67,1:37:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的同胞真合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your countrymen are being so cooperative…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.47,1:37:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,很急切的想要挽回面子\N{\fnArial\fs30}so predictably eager to save face.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.98,1:37:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的政府知道你在这里 他们正在找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}My government knows you're out here. They're looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.18,1:37:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我们的雷达显示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not according to our radar…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.22,1:37:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的米格机 快要攻击英国舰队\N{\fnArial\fs30}where it seems your MiGs are about to attack the British fleet…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.69,1:37:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有多久的时间？\N{\fnArial\fs30}in how many minutes?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.42,1:37:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,再九分钟就在射程范围内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nine minutes to firing range.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.48,1:37:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算他们正在找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And even if they were looking for me…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.26,1:37:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我们在隐形船上\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're on a stealth boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.26,1:37:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们看不见我 甚至你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't see me, or you…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.60,1:37:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是你的朋友…\N{\fnArial\fs30}or even your friend…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.07,1:37:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,死去的邦德中校\N{\fnArial\fs30}the late Commander Bond…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.60,1:37:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他这时正沉下南中国海底\N{\fnArial\fs30}who is at this moment on his way to the bottom of the South China Sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.31,1:37:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我的新主播\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's my new anchorman.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.76,1:37:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可怜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.63,1:38:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底发生了什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What on earth's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.90,1:38:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,007发出的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}A message from 007…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.37,1:38:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,也经中国情报主管证实\N{\fnArial\fs30}just confirmed by my opposite number in China.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.37,1:38:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,「要求舰队搜寻一艘雷达 几乎侦测不到的隐形船」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Tell the fleet to search for a ship that's almost invisible to radar."
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.54,1:38:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌人不是中国\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Chinese aren't the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.24,1:38:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡佛愚弄了我们双方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carver's been playing both sides for fools.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.75,1:38:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军 从海军总部发出的急电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral, sir, urgent message from the Admiralty.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.05,1:38:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.46,1:38:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,在雷达上侦测到任何小东西吗？像是救生艇或潜望镜吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything on radar that looks very small? Lifeboat, periscope, anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.36,1:38:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 隐形船？他们一定疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir. Stealth boat, sir? They have gone mad.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.07,1:38:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,林小姐 你将看到的不只是导弹攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you're about to witness, Miss Lin, is not so much a missile attack…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.84,1:38:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是一个新时代的诞生\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the launch of a new world order.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.91,1:38:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,五分钟后 你的同胞就会攻击英国舰队\N{\fnArial\fs30}In five minutes, after your countrymen have attacked the British fleet…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.68,1:38:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时候我将会帮英国报复\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall retaliate for dear old England…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.02,1:38:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,把导弹射向北京\N{\fnArial\fs30}by sending this missile into Beijing…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.92,1:39:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是张将军跟其他高级官员\N{\fnArial\fs30}where General Chang has just called an emergency meeting…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.43,1:39:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,召开紧急会议的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the Chinese high command.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.66,1:39:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不幸的是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.73,1:39:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,张将军因为交通挤塞将会迟到\N{\fnArial\fs30}General Chang will be delayed in traffic…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.00,1:39:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,会在其他领导人毙命后到达\N{\fnArial\fs30}arriving just after the missile has killed your leaders…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.84,1:39:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来不及阻止空军击沉英国舰队\N{\fnArial\fs30}and too late to stop the air force from sinking the entire British fleet.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.98,1:39:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他将会接管中国政府 与英国谈判停战\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he will be just in time to take over the government, negotiate a truce…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.18,1:39:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,摇身一变成为一个世界领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}and emerge as a world leader…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.99,1:39:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,还会获得诺贝尔和平奖\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a Nobel Peace Prize.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.62,1:39:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的好处呢？- 我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And what do you get? - Me?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.69,1:39:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.26,1:39:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有未来一百年 中国的独家电视广播权\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just exclusive broadcasting rights in China for the next hundred years.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.77,1:39:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经准备好攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready to rock and ruin.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.74,1:39:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,林小姐 请恕失陪 我有工作需要去完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'll excuse me, my dear, I have something of a deadline to meet.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.34,1:39:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备发射导弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare for the missile launch.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.58,1:39:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,古达先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Gupta.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.92,1:40:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 艾利欧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Elliot.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.35,1:40:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有趣的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interesting plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.72,1:40:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我有一些属于你的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I think I have something of yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.26,1:40:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,德国人的办事效率真高\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much for German efficiency. Mr. Stamper.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.70,1:40:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迟些才杀他 - 不要开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't shoot him yet. - Hold your fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.01,1:40:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生 欢迎参观这次世界危机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to my world crisis, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.14,1:40:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,公平的交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even trade, Elliot.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.28,1:40:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,古达换林葳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gupta for Wai Lin.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.21,1:40:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有他你无法发射导弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't fire the missile without him.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.91,1:40:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你好像抗拒不了 我拥有的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it seems you can't resist any woman in my possession.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.05,1:40:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还在等什么？射死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you waiting for? Shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.22,1:40:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已说了我们会一起完成任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you we're going to finish this together.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.46,1:40:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的非常浪漫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, how romantic.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.96,1:40:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你了解你现在的情况多荒谬吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you realize how absurd your position is?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.73,1:40:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,可没有你为了增加收视率 而发动战争那么荒谬\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more absurd than starting a war for ratings.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.50,1:40:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟人都是利用媒体去拯救世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great men have always manipulated the media to save the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.54,1:40:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,威廉赫斯特曾对他的摄影师说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at William Randolph Hearst, who told his photographers…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.80,1:41:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,「你提供照片 我提供战争」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"You provide the pictures, I'll provide the war."
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.41,1:41:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是先跨一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've just taken it one step further.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.55,1:41:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.75,1:41:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚才有点分心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tuned out there for a moment, Elliot.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.29,1:41:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,太可惜了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Touche.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.09,1:41:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,古达先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Gupta…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.39,1:41:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,导弹准备好发射没有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the missile ready to fire?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.23,1:41:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,一按下按钮 北京就会消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}Press the magic button, Beijing disappears.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.87,1:41:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你活得比你的合约长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it seems you've outlived your contract.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.31,1:41:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个备用计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, Mr. Bond, I have a backup plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.34,1:41:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-huh. So do I.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.90,1:42:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他炸开了船身 雷达将会侦测到我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's breached the hull. They'll see us on radar.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.30,1:42:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 我们收到 一个在水面上微弱 间断的讯号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, we have a small, intermittent contact on the surface.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.97,1:42:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,在方位112度标绘出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plot the bearing 1-1-2 degrees.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.88,1:42:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,讯号很微弱 但我发誓几秒前它不在雷达上\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a very weak signal, but I'd swear it wasn't there a second ago, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.11,1:42:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,通知舰队先别向中国发动攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeoman, tell all ships not to fire on the Chinese for any reason whatsoever.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.35,1:42:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,通知中国舰队指挥官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send the message to the Chinese fleet commander:
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.12,1:42:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,「发现不明船只」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Have sighted unknown ship…"
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.69,1:42:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,快将火扑灭！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get those fires out!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.63,1:42:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,下去保护导弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down there and protect the missile.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.80,1:42:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,史丹博 杀了那两个王八蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and Mr. Stamper, would you please kill those bastards?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.22,1:42:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,做得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice work.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.36,1:42:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们正在加速\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're speeding up.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.49,1:42:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须停止它 你能解决引擎室吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to stop the boat. Can you take care of the engine room?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.73,1:43:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然 - 好 做完后快离开船\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of course. - Good. Do it and get off the ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.13,1:43:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去阻止导弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to stop the missile.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.18,1:43:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,中国舰队指挥官发出的信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Signal from the Chinese fleet commander.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.78,1:43:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,「致皇家海军特遣舰队」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"To Royal Navy Task Group:
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.78,1:43:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我们的雷达也出现不明船只」\N{\fnArial\fs30}We also have the unknown ship on our screens.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.75,1:43:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,「除非它向我们攻击 否则我们将不会开火」\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will not fire unless it turns toward China.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.92,1:43:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,「它交由你们处理」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until then, she's yours."
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.79,1:43:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论那是什么 将它击沉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Captain, whatever the hell that thing is, sink it.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.19,1:43:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 回音是否太弱无法瞄准？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right, sir. - Is that echo too weak for missile lock?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.76,1:43:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, sir. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.17,1:43:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们采取传统的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll do it the old-fashioned way.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.31,1:43:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德让我们变成目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond turned us into the target.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.94,1:43:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也一起陪葬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Along with himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.98,1:43:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备迂回行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take evasive action.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.68,1:43:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,立即准备导弹倒数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare the missile countdown immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.08,1:43:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始发射程序 倒数五分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Initializing launch sequence."T" minus five minutes and counting.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:59.72,1:44:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒数五分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}"T" minus five minutes and counting.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.29,1:44:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们时速48海里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, sir, they're making 48 knots.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.49,1:44:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,两分钟后便超出射程范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll be out of range in two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:08.16,1:44:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续开火 拖慢他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep firing. Slow them down.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.56,1:45:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,引擎失灵 我们坐以待毙 引擎室\N{\fnArial\fs30}The engines are out. We're sitting ducks here. Engine room.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.01,1:45:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.92,1:46:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒数四分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}"T" minus four minutes and counting.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.14,1:47:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,做的好 最高速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done. Officer Watch, increase max.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:37.17,1:47:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续开火！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep firing!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:40.54,1:47:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人 弃船\N{\fnArial\fs30}All hands, abandon ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.28,1:47:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,弃船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abandon ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.20,1:48:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,史丹博 你要怎么处置那个女的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Stamper, what are you doing about the girl?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.67,1:48:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你该去引擎室看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you'd consider looking in the engine room.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.08,1:48:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒数三分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}"T" minus three minutes and counting.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.77,1:49:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又来迟了一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're too late again, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.57,1:49:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的坏习惯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a bad habit of yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:21.21,1:49:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无能为力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing you can do.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.09,1:49:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒数两分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}"T" minus two minutes and counting.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.06,1:49:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,导弹已输入程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}The missile's fully programmed.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.29,1:49:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能制止了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't be stopped.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.50,1:49:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的计划很快就会成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}In minutes my plan will succeed.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.60,1:49:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你的努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks largely to your efforts…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:45.77,1:49:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国海军会毁掉证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}the British Navy will destroy the evidence…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.20,1:49:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会离开这里 乘着卡佛新闻直升机…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll be out of here in a Carver news helicopter…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.18,1:49:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,作报导\N{\fnArial\fs30}covering the event.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.31,1:49:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,将会是很精彩的节目\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going to be a fantastic show.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:56.65,1:49:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能有个突发新闻要告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may have some breaking news for you, Elliot.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.32,1:50:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忘了大众传播的第一守则\N{\fnArial\fs30}You forgot the first rule of mass media, Elliot…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.69,1:50:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,满足人们的需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give the people what they want.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.21,1:50:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒数一分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}"T" minus one minute and counting.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:45.43,1:50:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,扔掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it, Mr. Bond…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:47.13,1:50:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则扔了你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I drop your friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.93,1:50:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都结束了 史丹博\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over, Stamper.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.27,1:50:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,放了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her go.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:54.00,1:50:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是你跟我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not between you and me.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.51,1:51:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,试用雷管 导弹会引爆\N{\fnArial\fs30}James, try the detonators. The missile will set them off.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.24,1:51:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟女性争辩 她们通常都对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never argue with a woman. They're always right.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.16,1:51:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒数四十秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}"T" minus 40 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:28.64,1:51:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,为卡佛报仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Carver!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.71,1:51:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有高夫曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Kaufman!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:45.25,1:51:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我欠了你一次痛苦的死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe you an unpleasant death, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:31.60,1:52:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒数二十秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}"T" minus 20 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.51,1:52:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起死\N{\fnArial\fs30}We die together, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.86,1:52:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒数十秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}"T" minus ten seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:17.71,1:53:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,三\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.35,1:53:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,二 一\N{\fnArial\fs30}two… one…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:15.47,1:54:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,M 比德福号报告 卡佛跟船一起下沉\N{\fnArial\fs30}M, Bedford reports Carver went down with the ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.47,1:54:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎邦德成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems that Bond made it.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.61,1:54:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱班霓 请你写下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moneypenny, take this release.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:24.71,1:54:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾利欧卡佛失踪了 怀疑他是坐他的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elliot Carver is missing, presumed drowned…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:27.22,1:54:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,豪华游艇在南中国海附近溺毙\N{\fnArial\fs30}while on a cruise aboard his luxury yacht in the South China Sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:33.16,1:54:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前当地警方相信…\N{\fnArial\fs30}At present the local authorities believe…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:36.16,1:54:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,该位媒体大亨是自杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the media mogul committed suicide.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:48.70,1:54:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德中校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander Bond…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:51.57,1:54:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,林上校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel Lin…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.51,1:54:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是英国皇家比德福号\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is the H.M.S. Bedford.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.65,1:54:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在那里吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you there?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:02.22,1:55:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们正在找我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're looking for us, James.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:06.32,1:55:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们再隐藏一会儿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's stay under cover.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.57,1:55:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,[将此片献给艾伯特·库比·布鲁克里]
